ch_hot&utm_medium=organic&utm_source=zhihu&type=content\"},{\"text\":\"日本东京发生持刀伤人事件致 2 死398 万\",\"href\":\"/search?q=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%9C%E4%BA%AC%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E6%8C%81%E5%88%80%E4%BC%A4%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E8%87%B4+2+%E6%AD%BB&search_source=Trending&utm_content=search_hot&utm_medium=organic&utm_source=zhihu&type=content\"},{\"text\":\"AI短剧《雪山救狐狸》爆火398 万\",\"href\":\"/search?q=AI%E7%9F%AD%E5%89%A7%E3%80%8A%E9%9B%AA%E5%B1%B1%E6%95%91%E7%8B%90%E7%8B%B8%E3%80%8B%E7%88%86%E7%81%AB&search_source=Trending&utm_content=search_hot&utm_medium=organic&utm_source=zhihu&type=content\"}],\"questionLinks\":[{\"text\":\"创作热点网传中科大一少年班同学课上往黑板扔水杯，如何评价其行为以及教授的处理方式？\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2020511540806254722\"},{\"text\":\"创作热点网传中科大一少年班同学课上往黑板扔水杯，如何评价其行为以及教授的处理方式？\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2020511540806254722\"},{\"text\":\"等你来答​\",\"href\":\"/question/waiting\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/48510028\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/48509984\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/510340037\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/48510028\"},{\"text\":\"知乎指南\",\"href\":\"/question/19581624\"}],\"editorContent\":null,\"editorContentLength\":0}', 445, 1, NULL, '2026-03-27 15:57:10');
