text\":\"为什么？\",\"href\":\"/question/20120168\"},{\"text\":\"针对当下走势，如何做到完全分类？\",\"href\":\"/question/427320517\"},{\"text\":\"有哪些对人进行分类的理论？\",\"href\":\"/question/55213544\"},{\"text\":\"对于世界本质的研究有哪些？\",\"href\":\"/question/573749338\"},{\"text\":\"知乎指南\",\"href\":\"/question/19581624\"}],\"editorContent\":\"\",\"editorContentLength\":0}', NULL, 285, 1, NULL, '2026-03-26 16:33:57');
