text\":\"一位高中生在币圈赚了12万rmb在同龄人中是什么样的水平?\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/668066878/answer/2020839185221779598\"},{\"text\":\"从100u到1000u要多久?\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/1962152582878310606/answer/1983559497944428935\"},{\"text\":\"Lv4\",\"href\":\"/creator/account/growth-level\"},{\"text\":\"草稿箱(4)\",\"href\":\"/creator/manage/creation/draft?type=answer\"},{\"text\":\"今日阅读 (播放) 数​118今日新增赞同数​1\",\"href\":\"/creator/analytics/work/all\"},{\"text\":\"今日阅读 (播放) 数​118今日新增赞同数​1\",\"href\":\"/creator/analytics/work/all\"},{\"text\":\"今日阅读 (播放) 数​118今日新增赞同数​1\",\"href\":\"/creator/analytics/work/all\"},{\"text\":\"今日阅读 (播放) 数​118今日新增赞同数​1\",\"href\":\"/creator/analytics/work/all\"},{\"text\":\"今日阅读 (播放) 数​118今日新增赞同数​1\",\"href\":\"/creator/analytics/work/all\"}],\"questionLinks\":[{\"text\":\"都说量化需要数学好，本科数学水平能达到入门级量化策略的要求吗？\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/1929476552388735749/answer/2014121482289180704\"},{\"text\":\"当你达到了什么状态，确定自己可以依靠交易为生了？\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/37277499/answer/2020449864970970436\"},{\"text\":\"为何没人告诉董明珠玫瑰空调很丑？\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/639028516/answer/2018897657360306805\"},{\"text\":\"为什么很多人一口咬定新冠病毒就是美国的生物战？\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/535982150/answer/2018695335636124864\"},{\"text\":\"一位高中生在币圈赚了12万rmb在同龄人中是什么样的水平?\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/668066878/answer/2020839185221779598\"},{\"text\":\"从100u到1000u要多久?\",\"href\":\"//www.zhihu.com/question/1962152582878310606/answer/1983559497944428935\"},{\"text\":\"等你来答​\",\"href\":\"/question/waiting\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/48510028\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/48510028\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/48510028\"},{\"text\":\"​\",\"href\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/48510028\"},{\"text\":\"知乎指南\",\"href\":\"/question/19581624\"}],\"editorContent\":null,\"editorContentLength\":0}', NULL, 236, 1, NULL, '2026-03-27 15:54:41');
